Package: oogrepz
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: COMPRESSED STREAM SEARCH
 Zero-copy streaming search across gzip, bzip2, xz, and zstd compressed archives.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 regular pattern matching, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
